{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他舍不得少喜欢一点，也不想再因怕受伤，一高兴就把心收回去。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得少喜欢\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他想起安心靠近、真心对人好、独自想着对方时都曾很快乐，这些快乐并非等到对方许诺才有。\",\n      \"key\": \"安心靠近\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他肯顺着想亲近的念头多停一会儿，心里也有了些玩心。\",\n      \"key\": \"有了些玩心\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道对方没给过保证，也还盼着回应，可有一阵他只顾着高兴，几乎顾不上担心会落空。\",\n      \"key\": \"只顾着高兴\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他刚肯放开喜欢，心里就隐约怕这样的亲近转眼过去。\",\n      \"key\": \"转眼过去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R33\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S08-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把抽象的管住喜欢改成他因怕受伤而一高兴就收回心意，保留舍不得减轻深情、因此放松自我约束的因果，并承接 S07-5。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R34\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S08-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留安心靠近、真心给予、独自珍藏三种真实快乐，以及它们并非建立在对方许诺之上的共同点。R34仍是本段重新投入的依据，R69仍承担结尾回顾全程的功能。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R35\", \"R36\", \"R37\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S08-1\", \"S08-2\", \"S08-3\", \"S08-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并重分\",\n      \"why\": \"把过去的快乐确实存在、愿意顺着喜欢投入、仍盼回应却暂时顾不上担心分开写清。删去眷恋成了坦然热情的作者总结；不再重复计算付出多少，因为 S04-3 已写过，心意加深时不再收回则由 S08-1 保留。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R38\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S08-4\", \"S08-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并补足\",\n      \"why\": \"保留欢喜暂时盖过顾虑、对方仍未作出保证的事实，不把短暂放松写成矛盾已经解决。另补出刚肯放开心时便隐约怕亲近转瞬即逝的心理过程，由 S02-2 想让相处久一点、S07-4 知道眼前时刻留不住提供前因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ac7be69d-d72c-475c-9a64-f3aa1a249fa5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T084321805999Z", "elapsed_seconds": 873.312, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T08:57:55.123098+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c9c03ed06d6f22041a9a203a6fa8f462310f58d0a07b4e0eef0276d0f199929d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T084321805999Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "e27dc74d5be5176bff79ecfebdbf8be320839181814eef1a3d5809d01f990ced"}}}
